+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items and returns findings for a human finance operator. The review is intended to identify duplicate invoice references and arithmetic mismatches.
+
+## Current implementation
+
+The source defines invoice lines with a string reference and an amount in cents. It implements detection of repeated references and returns the unique duplicate references in sorted order.
+
+Arithmetic-mismatch review is described by the README but is not implemented in the current source.
+
+## Boundaries
+
+- Findings support human finance review.
+- The project never authorizes or sends a payment.
